<title>USA: Kenosha Cty, Wis., $29.025 mln won by PaineWebber.</title>
<headline>Kenosha Cty, Wis., $29.025 mln won by PaineWebber.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber said it won $29.025 million of Kenosha Cty, Wis., general obligation detention facility bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.511 percent.</p>
</text>
